SUMMARY:Deadline: Prototype Fund Class 03 (Open-Source Software)
DESCRIPTION:Prototype Fund supports the development of socially relevant op
 en-source software\, offering low-threshold funding and coaching to indivi
 dual developers and small teams. ELIGIBILITY: individual developers or tea
 ms of up to four\; funded members must reside in the EU and the lead entit
 y must be based in Germany. Application window 1 October to 30 November 20
 26.\n\nOrganisation: Prototype Fund (Open Knowledge Foundation Germany)\nL
 ocation: Germany / EU (lead must be based in Germany\; funded members must
  reside in the EU)\nAward: Up to EUR 95\,000 over 6 months\, or up to EUR 
 158\,000 over 10 months\, plus coaching. No application fee.\nDuration: 6 
 or 10 months\n\nMore: https://www.prototypefund.de/en/application?utm_sour
 ce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.prototypefund.de/en/application?utm_source=artificialnouvea
 ugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Germany / EU (lead must be based in Germany\; funded members must 
 reside in the EU)
END:VEVENT
