 rd: Two-year research projects: 55% employment for the research assignment
  over 24 months (contractual project staff member) plus EUR 2\,000 in oper
 ating funds (EUR 1\,000 per project year). No application fee.\nDuration: 
 Two-year projects (24 months). Projects start at the earliest 20 September
  2027.\n\nMore: https://www.ap-arts.be/en/submit-research-proposal-royal-a
 cademy-fine-arts-antwerp?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=
 referral
